&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1566&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4a242ca8649a&quot;&gt;Own CI and test infrastructure across the SDK repositories: set health targets, detect and quarantine flaky tests, and provide test frameworks that engineers and coding agents can run locally&lt;/p&gt;
