&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;Provide competitive intelligence and market feedback to Product, Marketing, and GTM leadership to inform roadmap, localized product requirements, and positioning decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
