&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4934&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to coach AEs through complex, multi-threaded deals and develop talent at all levels of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
