&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Netlify&#39;s Finance team builds the financial foundation that helps the company plan, operate, and make informed decisions. The team owns our operating model, management reporting, budgeting and planning, and the company-level metrics leadership uses to understand performance and make tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Finance Manager, you&#39;ll own the corporate finance cycle and decide what it should become. That covers monthly reporting, the driver-based forecast, annual planning, scenario work, and the KPI layer, and it extends past running them well into bringing your experience to improve and innovate on our processes. This is a hands-on role with real latitude: you will work directly with senior leadership on capital, pricing, and headcount decisions, and will leverage AI to build better tooling and make Finance faster and less dependent on manual work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the corporate finance cycle end to end, including the monthly reporting package, the driver-based forecast, annual planning, and scenario analysis, and redesign the parts that no longer hold up as we scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frame which scenarios are worth running ahead of capital, pricing, and headcount decisions, and bring a recommendation rather than a set of outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the annual planning process across departments, from calendar and templates through consolidation and board-ready output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional alignment on metric definitions, reporting dimensions and financial data hygiene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the company-level KPI and metrics layer, decide what leadership measures as the business evolves, and carry a view on the trends driving each metric&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive market and competitor research to support pricing and packaging, capital allocation, and improve financial forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex financial mechanics to people outside finance, and drive cross-functional decisions and leadership buy-in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set how budget management runs across departments, including the cadence and what a department leader is accountable for, rather than tracking it on their behalf&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a thought leader steering the finance function&#39;s AI operating standard and build the systems and agents to support it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales leadership on capacity model and KPI tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in FP&amp;amp;A or strategic finance, including several years at a SaaS or usage-based business. An investment banking, consulting or private equity background preferred; but strong modeling skills, ability to develop frameworks to solve complex problems and ability to run scenarios is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple annual planning cycles owned end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of building 3-statement models from scratch, with scenario and sensitivity analysis, and of making structural changes to a model rather than only updating inputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of US GAAP and core accounting principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Google Sheets or Excel, and comfort with large datasets and formula-heavy models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort framing abstract business problems and creating frameworks to address them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep system-level understanding of how financial data moves across source systems, the warehouse, and the planning and reporting layer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep command of SaaS metrics and their drivers, with a point of view on which ones actually matter at our stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building AI workflows other teams adopt, and a clear view on where the human checks belongs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting analysis and recommendations to executive staff, and a track record of driving org level impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep curiosity about our business, product, customers, competitors and industry trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Role Is a Great Fit If&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to own a function, not contribute to one. The corporate finance cycle would be yours to run and to redesign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable being the only person on this work. There is no junior analyst supporting the role and no plan to add one. You will build it and run it yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re deeply curious about industry. You keep up to date with industry trends, research the competitive landscape, and you turn that into a recommendation rather than an observation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You notice when something is slower or more manual than it needs to be, and you fix it without being asked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re excited to build. The tooling, the reporting layer, and the automation work are all genuinely open, and there is room to make this function structurally better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our applications will close on Friday, November 13th at 5pm CST&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applying&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet 100% of our qualifications? Please apply anyway!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When applying please include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A resume or short listing of your job history &amp;amp; skills (link to a LinkedIn profile would be fine). We appreciate a cover letter explaining why you would enjoy working in this role at Netlify to get to know you a bit better, though this is not required and will not impact your application. Our mission is to &quot;build a better web&quot; and that cannot be done without a diversity of skill sets, backgrounds and thoughts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Of everything we&#39;ve ever built at Netlify, we are most proud of our team. Netlify is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We are devoted to building a team of people with diverse backgrounds and lifestyles. Driving equality empowers our team, enables us to innovate, and helps us maintain a more inclusive environment. We don&#39;t discriminate against employees or applicants based on gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, race, military/veteran status, citizenship, pregnancy status, or any other differences. If we can do anything to provide a better interview, i.e. accommodate a disability, then please let us know by emailing &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@netlify.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@netlify.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Netlify&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Netlify is the most popular way to build, deploy, and scale modern web applications, empowering everyone from fast moving solo developers to enterprise teams. Millions of developers and organizations rely on Netlify as their platform of choice for composing web applications that are production ready, performant, and flexible. Now, as we embrace the next era of software development, we are embedding the same fluid, intuitive experience into the Agent Experience (AX), making it just as simple for intelligent agents to understand, interact with, and act on our platform as it is for developers. Whether your user is human or machine, Netlify ensures the path from idea to URL is seamless, fast, and deeply reliable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Series D company that has raised over $200M from investors such as Andreessen Horowitz, Kleiner Perkins, EQT, Bessemer, BOND, and Menlo Ventures. As a fully distributed company, we aim to create a company culture where the best idea can come from anywhere and strive to be thoughtful, compassionate, and collaborative in our work. If this sounds like something you&#39;d like to be part of, we&#39;re excited to connect with you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Netlify, we are committed to a compensation philosophy that prioritizes fairness and equity, positions our employee compensation competitively in the market, recognizes and rewards performance, and takes a comprehensive approach to our rewards package. We anchor our compensation philosophy on a market-based approach, therefore salary ranges may differ depending on the labor cost in a particular location. The salary provided is in addition to robust benefits and participation in Netlify&#39;s equity plan. Our hiring range for this role is targeted at $150,000 - $208,000 for most US-based locations. Candidates outside the US or in premium markets should consult with their Talent Acquisition partner regarding location-based ranges, as they may be higher or lower than the average US range listed. The starting pay will be determined based on multiple factors, including expertise and skills, market demands, experience, internal equity, and applicable geographic location. These compensation packages and ranges are subject to change and may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez &lt;strong&gt;VML&lt;/strong&gt;, nous croyons que les grandes idées naissent quand les talents peuvent être pleinement eux-mêmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Née en 2024 de la fusion de &lt;strong&gt;Wunderman Thompson&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;VMLY&amp;amp;R&lt;/strong&gt;, deux agences parmi les plus créatives et primées au monde, VML est aujourd’hui une agence internationale de référence, au croisement de la &lt;strong&gt;créativité&lt;/strong&gt;, de la &lt;strong&gt;technologie&lt;/strong&gt; et de la &lt;strong&gt;data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propulsée dans le TOP 5 des agences créatives aux Cannes Lions 2025, et réitérant cette performance en se classant dans le TOP 4 aux derniers Cannes Lions 2026, VML a aussi été récompensée dans toutes les compétitions majeures cette année. Leader reconnu sur l’IA, et en forte croissance sur toutes nos expertises, nous sommes auréolés depuis le 1er janvier 2026 du titre d’&lt;strong&gt;Agence de Communication Intégrée de l&#39;Année&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre force ? Une approche intégrée qui réunit &lt;strong&gt;Brand Experience (BX)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Customer Experience (CX)&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;Commerce (CO)&lt;/strong&gt; pour concevoir des expériences de marque uniques, impactantes et durables - pour les consommateurs comme pour les marques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML a également lancé &lt;strong&gt;VML Consulting&lt;/strong&gt; en 2025 (&lt;em&gt;désormais &lt;strong&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;), une entité spécialisée dans la transformation des entreprises centrée sur le client. Cette initiative stratégique qui a fait suite à l&#39;intégration réussie de Velvet Consulting, cabinet de conseil reconnu. &lt;strong&gt;VML Consulting&lt;/strong&gt; incarne la dimension conseil du groupe et fédère, à l’échelle internationale, l’ensemble des &lt;strong&gt;expertises technologiques et data&lt;/strong&gt; de VML.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avec &lt;strong&gt;plus de 30 000 talents dans le monde&lt;/strong&gt;, dont plus de &lt;strong&gt;500 en France répartis entre Paris &amp;amp; Toulouse&lt;/strong&gt;, VML est avant tout une communauté de profils passionnés : créatifs, stratèges, designers, développeurs, experts data, social media, influence, gaming, IA, CRM, e-commerce… Des expertises diverses, une même envie : &lt;strong&gt;imaginer ce qui fait avancer les marques et les usages&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travailler chez VML, c’est :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-évoluer dans un environnement &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;collaboratif et pluridisciplinaire&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-apprendre en continu sur des projets ambitieux et internationaux,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-contribuer à des campagnes reconnues et primées (&lt;strong&gt;Cannes Lions, Effie Awards, Grand Prix Stratégies…&lt;/strong&gt;),&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;et faire partie d’une agence élue&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Agence de Communication Intégrée de l’Année&lt;/strong&gt; en 2022, 2023 et 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre culture&lt;/strong&gt; repose sur la passion, l’audace créative, l’ouverture et une obsession de l’innovation — avec la conviction que la performance durable commence toujours par les talents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Envie de grandir, d’apprendre et de créer avec nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rejoignez l’aventure VML !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons notre futur(e) &lt;strong&gt;Stagiaire Planning Stratégique Social&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;au sein d&#39;une équipe dédié à un client international prestigieux. Au carrefour de la data, de la culture digitale et de la stratégie de marque, tu décrypteras ce que disent les communautés pour transformer les conversations en insights actionnables, en recommandations percutantes et en briefs créatifs inspirants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Démarrage&lt;/strong&gt; : Janvier 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tes missions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Social Listening, Veille &amp;amp; Intelligence Culturelle&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitorer et analyser les conversations en ligne via nos outils de social listening sur nos marques, nos concurrents et nos industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Décrypter les tendances émergentes (TikTok, Reels, formats vidéo, mèmes, communautés de niche) et identifier les opportunités de &lt;em&gt;newsjacking&lt;/em&gt; ou de prise de parole rapide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des rapports de veille et d’écoute synthétiques et visuels qui donnent du sens à la data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Planning Stratégique &amp;amp; Recommandations&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l’élaboration des recommandations stratégiques (idées, activations, calendriers éditoriaux).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des briefs d’action social media : angles d’attaque, tone of voice, formats prioritaires, KPIs attendus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nourrir les équipes en insights culturels et comportementaux frais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Suivi de Production (Touche-à-tout)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider à la déclinaison et au suivi de production des assets de contenu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre la main à la pâte : tester des formats, prototyper des idées et soutenir l’équipe opérationnelle au besoin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Lab IA &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utiliser et tester activement les outils d’IA générative pour accélérer la recherche, l’analyse et l’idéation créative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt; Bac+4/5 (École de communication, commerce, IEP, CELSA ou Master spécialisé) à la recherche d’un stage de césure ou de fin d&#39;études.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Internet &amp;amp; Social Native :&lt;/strong&gt; Une passion réelle pour l&#39;écosystème digital et les usages de communautés (TikTok, Instagram, X, Reddit, Discord).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacité d’analyse &amp;amp; d’insight :&lt;/strong&gt; Aptitude à transformer de la data brute et du bruit conversationnel en angles stratégiques exploitables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aisance rédactionnelle &amp;amp; Storytelling :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu as une belle plume, l’esprit de synthèse et le sens du design de présentations (Google Slides, PowerPoint, Keynote).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agilité IA :&lt;/strong&gt; Curieux(se) et déjà utilisateur(trice) d&#39;outils d’IA générative au quotidien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement international&lt;/strong&gt; : Aisance professionnelle en anglais, à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral, pour analyser des conversations mondiales, concevoir des présentations et échanger avec les équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Executive Assistant in the Office of the Chief Financial Officer (CFO), you’ll support multiple senior leaders in GitLab’s Finance Group, helping them focus on their priorities through proactive calendar, travel, and expense management. Reporting to the Senior Executive Business Partner to the CFO, you’ll be part of an integrated model that gives Finance leadership balanced, consistent support. You’ll work across time zones, help coordinate team events and projects, and partner with colleagues to keep day-to-day operations running smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively manage complex calendars across multiple time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate domestic and international travel, including flights, hotels, and visas where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage expense reporting and reconciliation for each executive accurately and on time, following GitLab&#39;s travel and expense policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Senior Executive Business Partner in coordinating Finance leadership&#39;s recurring activities, including maintaining shared Office of the CFO resources, distribution lists, Slack channels, and shared calendars.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help plan team events, off-sites, and large meetings with cross-functional partners and the Senior Executive Business Partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle highly confidential financial, personnel, and material non-public information with discretion, following GitLab&#39;s insider trading and quiet period policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide coverage and backup for the CFO&#39;s Senior Executive Business Partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience providing executive-level administrative support in a fast-paced environment and supporting multiple senior leaders at once, tailoring your approach to each leader while maintaining consistent support. Public company or Office of the CFO or Chief Executive Officer experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Google Workspace, Zoom, Slack, Navan, and related tools and processes, such as purchase orders, with the ability to learn new technical tools quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working independently, moving quickly between tasks, and using sound judgment to prioritize, solve problems, and anticipate executive needs, including knowing when to escalate competing vice president priorities to the Office of the CFO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and communication skills, attention to detail, and the ability to build collaborative relationships across teams, including with other Executive Business Administrators and stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using artificial intelligence (AI) to make day-to-day operations more efficient while protecting information and maintaining confidentiality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in an all-remote, distributed environment, with a willingness to help others and contribute to a positive, one-team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to travel occasionally, both domestically and internationally, to support executives, team off-sites, and key events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value diverse backgrounds and transferable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Executive Business Administration function supports GitLab leaders by creating the operational foundation for effective work in an all-remote, asynchronous environment. The Office of the CFO brings the CFO&#39;s leadership team together under one operating model. Its Executive Business Administrators work as one team, using shared standards and templates, a common schedule of recurring activities, coordinated coverage, and a shared view of Finance leadership priorities. This approach helps the CFO and vice presidents receive consistent support as the organization grows.&lt;/p&gt;
